{"id":"n90812-1-9","stage":4,"title":"죄책감 · 负罪感","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90812-1-9-1","ko":"어머니를 보살펴 드리지 못한 건 모두 다 제 잘못이에요.","zh":"没能照顾好母亲，全都是我的错。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니를","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니를","audio":"/audio/764b0fa53b4990f1e0d6.mp3"}},{"text":"보살펴","meaning":"照看，照顾","explanation":"보살피다：照看，照顾；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보살피다","audio":"/audio/0130597be7bbffc9a123.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14508","senseId":"1","lemma":"보살피다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보살펴","audio":"/audio/f67b889647fc385d1233.mp3"}},{"text":"드리지","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드리지","audio":"/audio/9a5744dfa214a4e01beb.mp3"}},{"text":"못한","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못한","audio":"/audio/ef515538c3621ef7d6ed.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"모두","meaning":"全部，所有","explanation":"모두：全部，所有","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64739","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못이에요.","meaning":"错，错误","explanation":"잘못：错，错误；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62477","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못이에요","audio":"/audio/8d7f316f74163ab89962.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"0130597be7bbffc9","term":"보살피다","zh":"照看，照顾","audio":"/audio/0130597be7bbffc9a123.mp3","entryId":"14508","definition":"精心保护和帮助。","pronunciation":["보살피다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"没能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26838","definition":"表示之前的话所指的行动未能达成或没有做该事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"全部，所有","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"64739","definition":"一个不剩或一个不漏的全体。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错，错误","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62477","definition":"做不好或做错的事。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]}],"audio":"/audio/a1074d964a40b906cc6c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90812-1-9-2","ko":"너무 죄책감을 가지지 마세요.","zh":"请不要有太大的负罪感。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"죄책감을","meaning":"负罪感","explanation":"죄책감：负罪感；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"죄책감","audio":"/audio/184e0c9c5104878691c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90812","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄책감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄책감을","audio":"/audio/c99f063a89f6c34aed96.mp3"}},{"text":"가지지","meaning":"怀有，感","explanation":"가지다：怀有，感；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"11","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지지","audio":"/audio/29ef0405bc5e5ab65e08.mp3"}},{"text":"마세요.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마세요","audio":"/audio/0a355a328a450c9b0583.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"184e0c9c51048786","term":"죄책감","zh":"负罪感","audio":"/audio/184e0c9c5104878691c8.mp3","entryId":"90812","definition":"对自己犯下的罪孽或错误，产生责任感的心绪。","pronunciation":["죄ː책깜","줴ː책깜"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"怀有，感","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"心里有想法、态度、思想等。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3bcd1f694258358eba15.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.117,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90812","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":148,"sequenceScore":2.9437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没能照顾好母亲，全都是我的错。","请不要有太大的负罪感。","听说敏俊的父亲今天凌晨去世了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没能照顾好母亲，全都是我的错。","请不要有太大的负罪感。","听说敏俊的父亲今天凌晨去世了。"],"answer":1}]}
